![Screenshot of the store](cover.png)

A project built for the [Nekki.cl](http://nekki.cl) consultancy. It
consisted of implementing a shopping cart using PHP and MySQL for the
"Boutique de Cervezas" store.

## Technologies

- Webpay KCC 6 integration
- OpenCart Ecommerce
- PHP
- MySQL

- <http://www.boutiquedecervezas.cl/shop/>
